<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has captured three areas in West Kordofan and advanced on Al-Nahud, while the RSF continues drone strikes that killed civilians in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile, and a Sudanese drone was shot down after crossing from Ethiopia. RSF forces also killed ten civilians in An-Nuhud, according to a relief group. Gold smuggled from Sudan is being routed through Ethiopia to the UAE, and Turkish support for the SAF is linked to ports, minerals and military bases. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9Sb255ek9CX0dfdjdIWUNqWDNzbUFKYWVjV1BQcDhXYXRkMV9kcjlaRG9EMGx1bWtBS1M4RmJCNW00N0d3MmJNa19DTm51S3c3cmZsLUVMcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNaHQ3OFN2Z0gxODlVcFExMkcyUGxyOFFJaFY3VWREVEJmSXFQcGFYVlQ3WUd6MTdKMGlTWEplV1R3c2toNG9hR1NQYWdQeDYtMkhNUnp6dFhYUS1tdkktOWt5QU9RZ01fS0xOdVF5WVkyR2o0UlktOGJXak1wWkhId1BQTU9DUWJtVVdwNzBGSGp2b2tCZU5mclVreTNJRmtVMXR0ZHYwaGtYQlNuSVg5RkVXZnc5T1R2OWJoWUlCYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOS0x3YnZ2dk1aR0NlNEx4ZGRjTWZzOEU4TklHeHE0aElOV2ZPQmNsdUt2b1pFMWJwcUpxNnRGM2wyNnNybVJJeEk1UUFqTjRIT09tSXlIY3JWdEJkWU1wSkZlcVNSOWxZcjBWQnQ2Q1lnRVNMNTBUTGFhWUhPN3BrNlJuQ0dHVHVEUVpPUzNfMkdOLXlHOGpfSVBHS21pUkxJV0NkT2J2Ry1zOX